BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Expected] Samsung/Google Android XR glasses preorders open
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261112
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261113
DTSTAMP:20261110T114926Z
UID:samsung-google-intelligent-eyewear-preorders-2026@headwear-calendar
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Launch
DESCRIPTION:Status: Expected\nType: launch\n\nPreorders for the Samsung an
 d Google Android XR 'Intelligent Eyewear' (designs with Gentle Monster and
  Warby Parker) reportedly open 12 Nov. The date comes from Warby Parker's 
 co-CEO on its Q3 earnings call and from Gentle Monster's website\; Samsung
  and Google have not confirmed it. Deliveries have reportedly slipped from
  November to mid-December. Reports differ on markets: Korean press mention
 s Korea\, the US and other major markets\, while Tech Times (citing NewsBy
 tes and GSMArena) says the first rollout covers only the US and South Kore
 a\, with Europe\, China and Japan excluded. No price announced yet.\n\nSou
 rces:\n- https://the-gadgeteer.com/2026/11/06/samsung-android-xr-glasses-p
 reorders-november-12/\n- https://engadget.com/2309631/googles-eyewear-part
 ners-cant-keep-a-lid-on-its-smart-glasses-plans\n- https://en.sedaily.com/
 finance/2026/11/09/samsungs-first-ai-glasses-open-for-preorder-on-the-12th
 \n- https://www.techtimes.com/articles/329847/20261101/samsung-smart-glass
 es-slip-december-google-keeps-gemini-conversations-18-months.htm\n\nLast c
 hecked: 2026-11-10
LAST-MODIFIED:20261110T000000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-ALLDAYEVENT:TRUE
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
END:VEVENT
